      "caption": "",
      "index": 0,
      "text": "Option A: Participate live during each live Zoom lecture. Join a live Zoom lecture. Use Poll Everywhere during the lecture. Note: You can get credit for participation once for each assignment. If you do the assignment in Poll Everywhere you do not need to do the asynchronous assignment. A zero will appear in the Canvas grade book if you do not complete the Poll Everywhere assignment. It will be deleted when your asynchronous assignment is graded. Option B: Participate asynchronously by watching the recorded Lecture Videos (posted at the bottom of the Learning Materials page for this module) and completing the following: After a video is posted, you can access the corresponding asynchronous participation assignment here: M3-1asy M3-2asy M3-3asy"
    }
